# Force binary handling for file types Git's text-detection heuristic can
# mis-classify (small/simple PDFs in particular can lack the NUL bytes Git
# uses to guess "binary", which would otherwise let core.autocrlf mangle
# line endings inside the compressed byte stream and corrupt the file).
*.pdf binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
